        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anuú Paulo, Ya/abusmoó Yesu Kristo as sla'aarír Mungú, barwaárí ngina gooiím amór múk Mungú oo baraá Efeso, kudá' Yesu Kristo ngwa haratlinti'iye'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mungú Baabuúrén nee Aako Yesu Kristo kuungá' nu tsuuqi nee nu waydií haniisi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mungú i xirfuuti, Baabuú Aakoorén Yesu Kristo. Inós atén tina tsuúq ar baraá Kristo ar tsuuqa sleémeero awa Qeeru, awa gawaá doori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós iimír yaamu ngiwa tleehhiiká, atén tina qaroó tsawaár ar baraá Kristo, as tawa múk taa hhoohhooeés oo xaslxaanslír koomaaká dír geeraawose asma sla'aarirós.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "inós atén tina tsawaár iimír aáng wa ale tiwa na/iiwós tleehhi ar loohír Yesu Kristo. Adoorí an adoodá' inós aa slaá' baraá muunaáwose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoorí gana tleéhh as atén tsuuqaawós kuká' xiríf kiwa ló'wa ilaiwawa/aan, as adoodá' inós tira ló'wa tsuúq, qoomár Garmaawós kuduú sla'aarusmo nguwa atén i haniís. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atén tina gweér baraá lawali'iimár Neetlaango, hingeemisuú tlakweema kway slawaán ar loohír gwa'arár Kristo. Gawaá adoorihe gurtleemuuwós ku ló'wa úr direne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gurtleemuuwí nguna atén i tlahhás. Adoorí gana tleéhh ar baraá sagalooarós nee xu'utirós sleémeero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós atén tina sla'aarirós i laqán, tidá' taa luú/, tidá' aa slaá' boo/eesaaro. Al'axweesani gana oó' adoorí ngiwa boo/eesi ar baraá Kristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sla'aarirós iimír aange a mura' sleémeero nguwa haragaasi ar baraá Kristo, kuduú baraá yaamu nee oo gawaá dooriwo, qoomaadá' bál bira bó/, Kristo tay saga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tam atén sleeme baraá Kristowo tina aaluuse tleéhh, adoodá' inós aa qaroó slaá', inósuudá' mura' sleémeero gu tlehhiít ar sla'aarirós. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma a sla'aarirós atén tawa xirfuuwós tleehhitaan baraá Kristowo, ateédá' Kristo ugwa geerií harahhifoórí gaasaan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' sleeme baraawose kángw looeema ugwa axasé', kangwdá' hhó' oo ba/amarhúng. Slám inós ugwa haratlintié', Qeeruú hhoohhoó' oo Mungú kudá' aa diréní al'axweés, nuri dugunií qaás. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qeeruuwí an arhaánír aalirén. Inós ngin xu'utimis dirén i aleeró adór ateédaá mukós tir gweeri. Gawaá adoorihe inós kuri xirfayees.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng aga axaás adór kuungá' Aako Yesu kura haratlintié', nee adór muu sleémeero oo taa hhoohhooeés kur sla'á'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe án Mungú un sluufmiís umú deelooro as kuungá' baraá firor'eene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munguú Aakoorén Yesu Kristo, Baabuú xirfuú koóm, aníng un firiiriím, as kahhó' kuungá' nuwa qeeruú sagalooárí haniisi nee geehhooeema as inós kuwa xua'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng a firiiriím inós ilaahúng awa qeeru ngiwa gweeri, as harahhifór ateetmorhúng kawa tsahha', nee daqaari'iimár xirif ar aalirós adór i diri' baraá múk taa hhoohhooeesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slám kawa xua' hhoohhooaarír uroó aleesleemuuwós baraá ateéká' haratlintatia'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "/Uuruudá' gadiyeé ga tleéhh baraarén wa ale an /uuruudá' Mungú ira gadiyuús qoomár Kristo nguwa waaslee/atís baraá múk aa qaátl wa ale, guri qaás dakós oo doó /iyáy gawaá dooriwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Guri waawuti'iimár i haniís daanduú geeraharuuse sleémeero, nee kudá' sleémeero aleesleemuú koomá', nee kudá' /uuruú koomá' nee daanduú kudá' sleémeero waawuti'ii'imá'. Inós kwaa qaás daanduú ume sleémeero ar mukdá' aleesleemuú koóm, kudá' baraá yaamuukií diriiá', nee kudá' baraá yaamaá hardahá' sleeme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mungú mura' sleémeero gwa gawaá dabaawós i qaás. Slám inós gun uráy haniis, as inós tawa ságw mukdá' inós gwa haratlintii', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee mukdá' tawa slaqwtós. Mukwí sleémeero aa haáts inose, inósuudá' umuúqo gaaro ga boo/eemiís baraá muu sleémeerowo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
